    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/613fa529eca3b465e20268928efea501.svg) ⟨28⟩\nCocoyawn32⟨28⟩\n/\ncosmos-predict2p5-cr1-empty-embedding⟨29⟩\nlike 0\nSize:  n<1K ⟨30⟩\nArXiv:\narxiv: 2602.06949\nTags:  dreamdojo ⟨31⟩ cosmos-predict2p5 ⟨32⟩ cr1 ⟨33⟩ text-embedding ⟨34⟩\nLicense:\nnvidia-open-model-license\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨35⟩ Community ⟨36⟩\nDataset Viewer\nThe dataset viewer is not available because its heuristics could not detect any supported data files⟨37⟩. You can try uploading⟨38⟩ some data files, or configuring⟨39⟩ the data files location manually.\n  * Contents⟨40⟩\n  * Usage⟨41⟩\n  * License⟨42⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨43⟩ CR1 empty-string text embedding for DreamDojo distillation \nThe empty-string text embedding used by every distillation stage of the DreamDojo⟨44⟩ pipeline (warmup + self-forcing).\nRedistributes a single ~103 MB file originally at:\n\n```\nnvidia/Cosmos-Predict2.5-2B → robot/action-cond/cr1_empty_string_text_embeddings.pt\n\n```\n\nThat upstream repo is gated and the license workflow is flaky for some users. This mirror avoids the gate for anyone reproducing our warmup / self-forcing runs on the `Cocoyawn32/dreamdojo-piper-warmup-4step` dataset.\n##   ⟨40⟩ Contents   \n| file  | size  | shape  | dtype  |  \n| --- | --- | --- | --- |  \n| `cr1_empty_string_text_embeddings.pt`  | 103 MB  | `(1, 512, 100352)`  | bfloat16  |  \nSanity check: `norm ≈ 7151.77`.\n##   ⟨41⟩ Usage \n\n```\nhf download Cocoyawn32/cosmos-predict2p5-cr1-empty-embedding \\\n  --repo-type=dataset \\\n  --local-dir /tmp/cr1\nln -sf /tmp/cr1/cr1_empty_string_text_embeddings.pt \\\n       datasets/cr1_empty_string_text_embeddings.pt\n\n```\n\n##   ⟨42⟩ License \nThe file itself is part of NVIDIA's `Cosmos-Predict2.5-2B` release, redistributed under the NVIDIA Open Model License⟨45⟩. Please review that license before use.\nCopy to bucket new \n\nDownloads last month\n    51\nTotal file size: 610 MB\n##  Paper for Cocoyawn32/cosmos-predict2p5-cr1-empty-embedding\n#### DreamDojo: A Generalist Robot World Model from Large-Scale Human Videos Paper • 2602.06949 • Published Feb 6 • 37 ⟨46⟩\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨47⟩ Privacy⟨48⟩ About⟨49⟩ Careers⟨50⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
